    {
      "la": "PRAEFATIO.",
      "column": "845d",
      "chunk": 0,
      "en": "PREFACE."
    },
    {
      "la": "SEQUITUR Decisio quaestionis de anima Christi, utrum aequalem cum divinitate scientiam habuerit.",
      "column": "847c",
      "chunk": 1,
      "en": "THERE FOLLOWS The determination of the question concerning the soul of Christ, whether it had knowledge equal with the divinity."
    }
  ],
  "headnotes": [
    {
      "la": "…latorem infamaret. Quapropter aeque cavendum mihi videtur, ut potissimum illic ubi sine periculo aliud sentiri non potest, nec facile nostra praesumamus asserere, nec aliena temere judicare. Novi enim",
      "en": "…l caution must be taken, that above all there, where nothing else can be held without danger, we should neither easily presume to assert what is ours, nor rashly to judge what is another's. For I know",
      "column": "845d",
      "chunk": 0
    },
    {
      "la": "ut dicit beatus Augustinus,",
      "en": "as blessed Augustine says,",
      "column": "845d",
      "chunk": 0
    },
    {
      "la": "Postremo quaedam verba beati Ambrosii in medium adducitis, et ne assertioni vestrae contraire videantur qualiter intelligenda sive determinanda sint demonstratis. Dicit enim",
      "en": "Lastly you bring forward into the midst certain words of blessed Ambrose, and, lest they should seem to run counter to your assertion, you show how they are to be understood or determined. For he says",
      "column": "855a",
      "chunk": 3
    }
  ],
